---
layout: layout.njk
title: 开放资源
permalink: /resources/index.html
---
<section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">OPEN SCIENCE</p><h1><span aria-hidden="true">🗂️</span> 开放资源</h1><nav class="toc" aria-label="资源目录">{% for item in collections.resources %}<a href="#{{ item.page.fileSlug }}">{{ item.data.resourceName }}</a>{% endfor %}</nav>
{% for item in collections.resources %}<article class="resource-row" id="{{ item.page.fileSlug }}"><aside><span class="resource-name">{{ item.data.resourceName }}</span><p>{{ item.data.year }} · {{ item.data.venue }}</p><div class="badges">{% if item.data.code %}<span class="badge">代码</span>{% endif %}{% if item.data.data %}<span class="badge">数据集</span>{% endif %}</div></aside><div><h2><a href="{{ item.data.paper }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h2><p class="resource-summary">{{ item.data.summary }}</p><dl class="resource-facts"><div><dt>Research problem</dt><dd>{{ item.data.problem }}</dd></div><div><dt>Method</dt><dd>{{ item.data.method }}</dd></div><div><dt>Resources</dt><dd>{{ item.data.resourceDescription }}</dd></div><div><dt>Use cases</dt><dd>{{ item.data.usage }}</dd></div></dl><div class="links">{% if item.data.paper %}<a href="{{ item.data.paper }}"><span aria-hidden="true">📄</span> 论文原文 ↗</a>{% endif %}{% if item.data.code %}<a href="{{ item.data.code }}"><span aria-hidden="true">💻</span> 访问代码 ↗</a>{% endif %}{% if item.data.data %}<a href="{{ item.data.data }}"><span aria-hidden="true">🗂️</span> 访问数据集 ↗</a>{% endif %}</div></div></article>{% endfor %}<p class="source">下载、使用和引用资源前，请查看原项目的许可、数据说明与引用要求。</p></section>